  "scope": "Exact dyadic interpretation of saved atomic positions: each fixed packet is supported in a cube of full side D<=a/n. It may cross origin0 fine-cell boundaries, but support containment is checked independently of that grid.",
  "conditional_paid_branch_derivation": [
    "For a fixed packet of full mass M and support cube center c, capture >eta*m and hardband m/R^n>2lambda imply R^n<M/(2eta lambda).",
    "At least one captured packet atom lies within R/2 of x, so |x-c|inf<=R/2+D/2<=(1+D/a)R/2.",
    "The corresponding receiver cube volume is at most (1+D/a)^n*M/(2eta lambda). Sum once over the fixed disjoint source allocation: lambda|Epaid|<=max_packet(1+D/a)^n*W/(2eta).",
    "By u<=4lambda, integral_Epaid u<=2*max_packet(1+D/a)^n*W/eta. This pays only its intersection with the current original residual and must not be added again to overlapping paid traffic."
  ],
